OL,3,AObama blasts federal probe of
OL,4,Acongresswoman Ilhan Omar as 'so
OL,5,Aappalling'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBarack Obama has said congresswoman
OL,8,FIlhan Omar is under federal criminal
OL,9,Finvestigation simply because she's an
OL,10,Foutspoken critic of the President
OL,11,FDonald Trump.
OL,13,F"The full weight of the federal
OL,14,Fgovernment is being brought down on a
OL,15,Flaw-abiding elected official because
OL,16,Fshe has dared to criticize the
OL,17,Fpresident," the former US president
OL,18,Fwrote on X, calling the probe "so
OL,19,Fappalling".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
