OL,3,AObama blasts federal probe of
OL,4,Acongresswoman Ilhan Omar as 'so
OL,5,Aappalling'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe White House defended the inquiry,
OL,8,Fsaying the justice department was
OL,9,F"focused on restoring law and order".
OL,11,FLast week, homeland security agents
OL,12,Fsearched the Minnesota Democrat's
OL,13,FWashington DC home as part of an
OL,14,Finvestigation into her immigration
OL,15,Fstatus. Born in Somalia, Omar moved to
OL,16,Fthe US with her family as a child.
